   "en": "Rise up out of my bones, some avenger, to come — whoever you are — and hound the settlers of Troy with fire and sword, now, or in time to come, [whenever|15,18] the strength [arises|16,17]: I call on shore to stand against shore, sea against sea, weapon against weapon — let them fight, they and their children's children after them.'",
